You can handle these things this way:

When he escapes upstairs, go there after him, up the same stairs, but DON'T 
leave the stairs to chase him further. Wait for him. And when he is next to
you, don't hit him there, but go down the stairs instead. He will usually
follow you, and now YOU stand on the stairway leading up, on exactly the
place where he would teleport to recover. THERE you can bash him, and he 
won't teleport to anywhere else, since you occupy the space he wants.
Just be careful not to move anywhere before you have killed him.
